```ts
function formatSAR(n: number | undefined | null): string {
  const v = typeof n === "number" && Number.isFinite(n) ? n : 0;
  return `${v.toLocaleString("en-US", { maximumFractionDigits: 2, minimumFractionDigits: 2 })} ر.س`;
}
```

That gives "1,234.50 ر.س" — clean and readable.

